<template><div><section><h2 id="details-setup">Key Features: huts and perks</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-setup-1" data-guide-step>Open the central route and choose a hut to explore. Record the perk revealed at each hut; locations are randomized between matches.</li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-2" data-guide-step>Use the Flogger and avoid becoming trapped in the slowing water. Keep an escape route when opening a new hut.</li>
